  "body": "Independent QA: **changes required**, superseding verdict comment 6067421414 after actual master advanced through PR436.\n\nThe native provider-remount credential overwrite (R1) remains reproducible on unchanged head `60eca5e0`. The owner must fix provider-lifetime cancellation and late-token handling, add maintained regressions, then reconcile the Test plan and current target context.\n\nI inspected the complete incoming target history and ten-file patch against actual master `9dc0739e`: no overlap with PR450\u2019s 36 paths; conflict probe clean. Auth behavior and capture inputs are unaffected, so original evidence identities remain applicable without relabeling them. API base still reports `4cbcbc74`; it is not the actual target.\n\n[Current bindings, target-impact assessment and preserved original findings/evidence](https://github.com/MChartier/calibrate-health/blob/83bdc1a9a09e1e03dab0489651cde268264010b9/final-verdict.json). No readiness, draft or merge action.",
